From 11231f4868ce4c743a414cf5aa648058e435edeb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ghosuto <clash.raja10@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 19:37:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] PixelOS: Status bar lyric follow-ups from Evolution-X cnb

Merge of Evolution-X commits (branch cnb):
- d21f19e7e3ca 'SystemUI: add LyricsFetcher for LRCLIB synced/plain lyrics'
- 743453ac7a16 'SystemUI: Remove broken app icon from statusbar lyric'
- 38d04ec71e4b 'SystemUI: Don't register LyricFetcher callback until
  setEnabled call'

Adaptation for PixelOS: the evox LyricsFetcher lifecycle changed across
those commits (addCallback/removeCallback API); here the fetcher is
created and start()ed lazily on first setEnabled(true) and fully
stopped on disable (its worker thread is quit by stop(), so it is
recreated on re-enable). LyricControllerModern wiring from evox
NowPlaying commit 2bccef6 is intentionally not ported.

Original author: Ghosuto <clash.raja10@gmail.com>

Change-Id: I2bf77ee388261f3259498f8b53acdce714700e9b
